---
import PresentationLayout from "@components/PresentationLayout.astro";
---

<PresentationLayout title="一个实际的案例" eyebrow="FUTURES · 期货三部曲 · WHY" narrow>
  <div class="slideRoot">
    <p class="lead">案例 · 大豆期货 1 手 = 10 吨，保证金率 10%。老李开多、小王开空，各交 <strong>¥5,000</strong> 押金。</p>

    <div class="tableWrap">
      <table class="table">
        <colgroup>
          <col class="colA" />
          <col class="colB" />
          <col class="colC" />
          <col class="colD" />
        </colgroup>
        <thead>
          <tr class="thead">
            <th scope="col" class="th thLeft">交易日</th>
            <th scope="col" class="th thCenter">合约价</th>
            <th scope="col" class="thGreen">多头保证金</th>
            <th scope="col" class="thRed">空头保证金</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="td tdLeft">第 1 天 · 开仓</td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCodeBold">¥5000</td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCode">¥5,000</td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCode">¥5,000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="td tdLeft">第 2 天 · 结算</td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCodeBold"><span class="numRed">¥4900</span></td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCode"><span class="numRed">¥4,000</span></td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCode"><span class="numGreen">¥6,000</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="4" class="tdNote">假设这 6 天行情逆转，合约价格一路上涨</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="rowWarn">
            <td class="td tdLeft">第 9 天 · 逼近强平</td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCodeBold"><span class="numRed">¥5450</span></td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCode"><span class="numGreen">¥9,500</span></td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCode"><span class="numRed">¥500 · 逼近</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="rowWarn">
            <td class="td tdLeft">第 10 天 · 大涨</td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCodeBold"><span class="numRed">¥5500</span></td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCode"><span class="numGreen">¥10,000</span></td>
            <td class="td tdCenter tdCode"><span class="numRed">¥0 · 强平</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="footerBar">
      <p class="footerText"><strong>关键在于 ·</strong> 价格大涨，空头小王的保证金跌破<strong>维持线</strong>先<strong>追保</strong>，不补就<strong>强平</strong>——在归零前就被平仓，正常不会变成负数；只有极端行情（跳空、连续涨跌停平不掉）才会<strong>穿仓</strong>变负。保证金 + 每日盯市，把违约风险按天清零，交易所才敢做所有人的对手方。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  /* ---- shared.layout: slideRoot ---- */
  .slideRoot {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 2.5rem 0.6rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ---- shared.shared: lead / footerBar / footerText ---- */
  .lead {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  .footerBar {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border-left: 3px solid #333;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    background: #fafafa;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .footerText {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* ---- page-specific ---- */
  /* Table wrapper */
  .tableWrap {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
    background: #fafafa;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .table {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }

  /* Header row background */
  .thead {
    background: #f3f4f6;
  }

  /* Column widths (applied to <col>) */
  .colA {
    width: 32%;
  }

  .colB {
    width: 22.7%;
  }

  .colC {
    width: 22.7%;
  }

  .colD {
    width: 22.6%;
  }

  /* Header rows */
  .th {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .thLeft {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .thCenter {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .thGreen {
    color: #15803d;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .thRed {
    color: #b91c1c;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Body cells */
  .td {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
  }

  .tdLeft {
    color: #666;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .tdCenter {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .tdCode {
    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
  }

  .tdCodeBold {
    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .numGreen {
    color: #15803d;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .numRed {
    color: #b91c1c;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* Full-width note row */
  .tdNote {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.3rem 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
  }

  /* Highlighted row */
  .rowWarn {
    background: #fff7f3;
  }
</style>